OL,3,AViolence breaks out in Ceuta as migrant
OL,4,Acrisis continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FA month after tens of thousands of
OL,7,Fmigrants entered the city of Ceuta, a
OL,8,FSpanish exclave in North Africa, there
OL,9,Fhave been outbreaks of violence as
OL,10,Ftensions mount between locals and
OL,11,Fforeign arrivals.
OL,13,FThe Spanish government has been accused
OL,14,Fby opposition parties of struggling to
OL,15,Fmanage the crisis effectively.
OL,17,FCeuta's residents have complained of
OL,18,Ffeeling unsafe on the streets, as well
OL,19,Fas expressing concerns about the burden
OL,20,Fbeing placed on public services.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
