OL,3,AViolence breaks out in Ceuta as migrant
OL,4,Acrisis continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 72,000 migrants crossed from
OL,7,FMorocco into Ceuta on 30 and 31 July.
OL,8,FMost swam around a border fence and at
OL,9,Fleast 100 people died during the mass
OL,10,Fcrossing, according to figures from
OL,11,FCeuta's mayor.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
